            <label class="segmented-option">
                <input type="radio" data-md-tab="split" /> <span>Split</span></label>
        </div>
    </div>
    <textarea class="form-input md-input" data-md-input rows="6" aria-label="Runbook">## Restarting the label printer

1. Open the queue and **pause** it.
2. Power the printer off for ten seconds.
3. Resume the queue and print one test label.
</textarea>
    <div class="markdown-body md-preview" data-md-preview></div>
</div>
